# Design System (Tukka)

All UI must use the design tokens. **Never hardcode** hex colors, font sizes, font
families, radii, or shadow values — import them from the token files below.

- Colors: `constants/Colors.ts` (`Colors` light/dark, raw `Palette`)
- Type: `constants/Typography.ts` (`FontFamily`, `Typography`)
- Spacing / Radius / Elevation: `constants/Theme.ts`
- Tag category colors: `constants/Tags.ts` (`TAG_COLORS`)

Read the user's theme with `useColorScheme()` → `Colors.dark | Colors.light`, and
color from `theme.*`. Use `Palette.*` only for fixed on-image colors (e.g. text on
a photo) where the theme value does not apply.

## When something is missing — ASK, do not guess

If a component, state, or pattern is **not covered** by this rule or the token
files, do not silently improvise. **Ask the user**: should I improvise within the
design language, or will you add the component to the design system? Only proceed
once they answer.

## Tokens

**Color** — Forest (structure/text) · Paper (surfaces) · Ochre (highlights) ·
Plum (map pins & live selection) · semantic.
- Primary action / text / active: Forest `#1C2A23` → `theme.accent` / `theme.text`
- Surfaces: Paper `#FBFAF5` cards, `#F4F1E8` background → `theme.surface` / `theme.background`
- Secondary text `#6F7D74` (`theme.textSecondary`), muted/meta `#9AA096` (`theme.textMuted`)
- Ochre `#C9912F` + `#F7ECD6` soft → `theme.ochre` / `theme.ochreSubtle` (ratings, soft tags)
- Plum `#6C3FD4` → `theme.plum` (map pins, selected state) — never as a button color
- Semantic: success/open `#3F8A5F`, warning `#D9772E`, error/closed `#C0492F`, info `#3A6FB0`

**Type** — Playfair Display (display/headings/place names), DM Sans (UI/body/labels),
DM Mono (uppercase metadata). Always use a `FontFamily.*` or a `Typography.*` style;
never `fontWeight` alone. Key styles: `display`, `heading1/2`, `title`, `placeName`,
`cardTitle`, `body`, `label` (14/600), `secondary`, `meta` (mono uppercase), `chip`, `button`.

**Spacing** `Spacing.space1..16` (4/8/12/16/24/32/48/64). **Radius** `Radius.sm|md|lg|xl|full`
(6/10/16/24/999). **Elevation** `Elevation.flat|card|float|sheet`.

## Component specs

- **Buttons** — Primary: Forest bg, `Palette.paper100` text, `Radius` 14, `Typography.button`.
  Secondary: Paper bg + 1.5px Forest border. Ghost: text-only, Forest (plum on press).
  Icon: round (`Radius.full`).
- **Tags / chips** — `Radius.full`. Selected = solid category color + paper text;
  unselected = soft (color at low alpha) + color text. Use `components/ui/TagChip.tsx`.
- **Inputs** — underline only: no fill, no radius, just a bottom border. Default 1px
  `theme.border`; focused 2px `theme.accent`; error 2px `theme.error` with a trailing
  `alert-circle` icon. Label on top in `Typography.label` / `theme.text` (not uppercase mono);
  value `Typography.body` / `theme.text`; placeholder `theme.textMuted`. Inline error in
  `theme.error`. Supports optional leading icon and a multi-line variant. Use `components/ui/Input.tsx`.
- **Cards** — `theme.surface`, `Radius.lg`, `Elevation.card`, no border. Featured place/city
  names in Playfair (`Typography.placeName`); meta line in `Typography.meta` or secondary.
- **City/place cards** — image on top (top-rounded, `overflow:hidden`), paper footer with
  Playfair name + `Country · N places` style meta.
- **Tab bar** — Forest active, sage `theme.tabIconDefault` inactive, paper surface.
- **Map pins** — Plum/category circle, paper border, `Elevation.float`; selected shows a
  paper callout card.

## Anti-patterns

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — hardcoded values
<View style={{ backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 16, padding: 16 }}>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '700' }}>Bar Botanica</Text>
</View>

// ✅ GOOD — tokens
<View style={[{ backgroundColor: theme.surface, padding: Spacing.space4 }, Elevation.card]}>
  <Text style={[Typography.placeName, { color: theme.text }]}>Bar Botanica</Text>
</View>
```
